Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.31,0:00:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.87,0:00:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.47,0:00:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.59,0:01:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All over the island, my\Nunwitting pawns are in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.23,0:01:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The duels have begun, and by now, the slow\Nprocess of elimination is well underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.97,0:01:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the strongest duel\Nmonsters players will survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.03,0:01:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and those of insufficient\Nskill will fall by the wayside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.57,0:01:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, bring them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.61,0:01:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm itching to duel, and I'm\Ntaking on the next player we see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.15,0:01:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm not so\Nsure Joey's up to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.15,0:01:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there are\Ntournament-level players here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.21,0:01:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't you think he's\Nsmart enough to realize?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.83,0:01:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I stand, the next\NDuel Monsters Champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.03,0:01:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs a reality check.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.07,0:01:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess he's about as smart as he looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.81,0:01:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better be the champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.21,0:01:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,For Serenity's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.67,0:01:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,She's always counted on\Nme, even when we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.27,0:02:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.09,0:02:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have you taken\Nme today, big brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.55,0:02:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,To the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.85,0:02:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you said you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.45,0:02:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.43,0:02:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the world's best brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.51,0:02:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.17,0:02:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.01,0:02:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And so cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What a great day!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.09,0:02:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.13,0:02:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.83,0:02:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.91,0:02:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Mom and Dad do get\Ndivorced and we have to live apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll still bring you back\Nto this place someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.61,0:02:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.97,0:02:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.63,0:03:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your big brother, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.55,0:03:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.11,0:03:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to win this\Ntournament and the prize money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.55,0:03:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make sure you\Ndon't lose your eyesight
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.45,0:03:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and show you that beautiful\Nocean one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.37,0:03:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Look there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.65,0:03:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel Monster Stadiums.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.17,0:03:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.33,0:03:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.93,0:03:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.19,0:03:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Lots of dueling going on. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.11,0:03:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going in you sure you want to do this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,if you lose you give\Nup your only star chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.57,0:03:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.03,0:03:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't panic. You can do this,\NJoey. You do know that, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.27,0:03:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're right Yugi this\Nwill be my first official
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.17,0:03:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,duel and I can't afford to get\Nknocked out at the start True,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.55,0:03:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but not everyone here is a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.63,0:03:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can find\Nsomeone on your level go
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.05,0:03:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,for someone easy Joey And\NI guess I should think
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.11,0:03:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,about what kind of field\Nmy cards are best suited
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,for they're mostly\Nmonsters and fighter types
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.11,0:04:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I guess that makes this\Nmeadow region my kind of turf.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.83,0:04:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.77,0:04:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.59,0:04:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You lost, Crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.33,0:04:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now give me your star chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.21,0:04:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A voice that annoying\Ncan only belong to...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,my...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.95,0:04:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.87,0:04:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You cheated somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.11,0:04:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you know what your cards\Nwere when they were still face down?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.97,0:04:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm psychic, and you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.31,0:04:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look who's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.53,0:04:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Mai's already won\Ntwo more Star Chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.45,0:04:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugi, are your duels going well?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.29,0:04:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm making progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.67,0:04:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So you have three Star Chips, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.09,0:04:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I might be up for a duel myself. Take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock her out of the\Ncontest and off the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.83,0:04:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, you know, I'm definitely in\Nthe mood for a duel right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.23,0:04:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So get ready, because I\Nchoose to challenge you, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.23,0:04:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.14,0:04:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You challenge me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.05,0:04:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have the guts to accept?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.79,0:05:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.70,0:05:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to play you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.79,0:05:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you heard about my skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.79,0:05:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't flatter yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.35,0:05:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I overheard you and Yugi\Ntalking on the boat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.07,0:05:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and I know he gave you the\Nonly star chip that you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.05,0:05:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My motto is, take out the\Nweakest players first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.45,0:05:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And considering that you wouldn't even be
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.05,0:05:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,here if Yugi hadn't given\Nyou one of his chips,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,you've got to be the weakest\Nduelist on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.55,0:05:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you have to be so... insulting?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This time she was being\Ntruthful. Huh? Mai's ruthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.49,0:05:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't duel her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.67,0:05:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If you lose this contest,\Nyou're out for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, stand up for Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.39,0:05:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to fight her in his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.87,0:05:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is his decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.21,0:05:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Show Mai what you're made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.89,0:05:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.80,0:05:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She thinks I'm a pushover,\Nbut she'll see. Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.51,0:05:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.09,0:05:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been more\Nserious. Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.85,0:05:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my chance to prove myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:05:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,To show everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.77,0:05:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, Gramps trained me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.42,0:06:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, Gramps didn't get a\Nchance to finish my training.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.87,0:06:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and granted,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I'd had a chance to\Npractice more before getting
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.99,0:06:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,thrown into a tournament this\Nhuge with so many heavy hitters,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.88,0:06:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I can take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.79,0:06:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.71,0:06:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You better be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.15,0:06:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,For your sister's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.11,0:06:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you better not screw this up, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept. Let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.49,0:06:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.15,0:06:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get her, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.25,0:06:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick her butt! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.15,0:06:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll do fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.01,0:06:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you only have one measly star chip,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I only have to bet one\Nof mine against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.17,0:06:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,At least this region will\Ngive me a field advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.69,0:06:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.69,0:06:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What are all those\Nmountains doing on my field?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.45,0:06:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The field we'll battle on is 40 % forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.29,0:06:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,40 % mountain, and the\Nlast 20 % is meadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.01,0:06:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So deal with it or surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.57,0:06:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Joey. You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.99,0:07:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monsters will still get a field power\Nbonus on the meadow part of the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.01,0:07:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.13,0:07:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Mai, not for nothing, but I gotta\Nask you one question before we duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.39,0:07:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you decide to take\Npart in this tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.33,0:07:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Mai, why is it you duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.37,0:07:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,For all the comforts that I crave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.39,0:07:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Designer clothes, travel, perks,\Nanything to avoid real work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.41,0:07:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot cars, turbocharged for living large.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.57,0:07:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why you want the prize money?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.65,0:07:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.73,0:07:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you try and judge me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.25,0:07:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are,\Nyou pathetic little snot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.63,0:07:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're only dueling for things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.09,0:07:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But for your information, some of\Nus fight for the people we love.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.03,0:07:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll show her, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.15,0:07:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Show her what it's like\Nto duel from the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.41,0:07:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.05,0:07:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So to start the game off,\NMasaki, the legendary swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.23,0:07:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, the field power bonus will\Nbring his power up over 300 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.81,0:07:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I made my first move. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.45,0:08:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.17,0:08:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.67,0:08:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.77,0:08:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Divining my card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to mystically choose which\None of them's the best. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.19,0:08:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you, a psychic?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And the best card would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.21,0:08:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The Harpy's Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Her strength is boosted by the\Nmountain's field power bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.57,0:08:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll still take it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.19,0:08:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.31,0:08:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Land monsters are at a\Ndisadvantage to flying monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.99,0:08:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsters that can fly\Nhave a magical resistance
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.49,0:08:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,against monsters that can\Nonly walk on the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So Joey blew it already? No,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.23,0:08:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but he attacked too soon before he thought\Nabout what her monster was capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My samurai sushi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.65,0:09:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, card, speak to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.95,0:09:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll choose again\Nwithout looking. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.95,0:09:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How's she doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.45,0:09:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's losing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.83,0:09:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that mop head wasn't\Nready for this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.77,0:09:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey, think about what you're\Ndoing before you move again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.79,0:09:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How can she read the cards\Nwhen they're lying face down?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.29,0:09:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My little card trick\Nhas made this kid forget
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.47,0:09:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,everything he ever knew\Nabout duel monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.51,0:09:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is just keep\Npushing his buttons. What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.81,0:09:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe eat this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiger Axe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.23,0:09:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My field power bonus should\Nraise its attack power,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.11,0:09:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,so it can take on the\NHarpies Lady head to head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.45,0:09:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.69,0:09:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still resistant to magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.41,0:09:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.32,0:09:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiger Axe is another\Nhandicapped Earth-based monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take stronger monsters than your\Nland-based wimps to beat my Harpy's Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.95,0:10:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll play this lovely\Ncard without even looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.97,0:10:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.35,0:10:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an equipment magic card that will\Nhelp me defeat your next card in one turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.61,0:10:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Again, with all that psychic stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.99,0:10:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Can she see my cards, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.01,0:10:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I can't see what she's\Nplaying, I gotta get defensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.61,0:10:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Running scared, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let me show you my surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.93,0:10:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyber Shield to juice up my Harpy's Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.75,0:10:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.91,0:10:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How's she doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.61,0:10:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.19,0:10:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you were wondering, the next card\Nyou were thinking of won't work either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.71,0:10:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai has ESP. It has to be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.77,0:10:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to lose this duel match\Nand the chance to save my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.13,0:10:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This game is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.87,0:11:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't win against me. She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.25,0:11:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,She's too much for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.61,0:11:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, remember what my grandpa taught\Nyou about how to play duel monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.49,0:11:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let her rattle you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.09,0:11:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just trying to psych you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.41,0:11:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.73,0:11:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brainless cheerleading\Nisn't going to help
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.77,0:11:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,him against the superior\Npower of my harpy ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.79,0:11:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you guys get it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.77,0:11:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendship doesn't win duels, never will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.17,0:11:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It hasn't helped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.11,0:11:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He's defeated and he knows it. Not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I beg to differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.79,0:11:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There can be only one champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,On this island, in this game,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.89,0:11:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,someone can be your best friend\Ntoday and your worst enemy tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.17,0:11:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the competition forces you\Nto face each other in a duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.67,0:11:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,where's your friendship then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.93,0:11:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why the only person a\Nduelist can trust is himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.63,0:11:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that your defeat today\Nteaches you that lesson, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.71,0:11:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's losing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.99,0:11:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.07,0:11:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.21,0:12:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.01,0:12:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to her, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.51,0:12:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to help you, just\Nlike you're always there for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.05,0:12:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.71,0:12:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.95,0:12:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just trying to divide and conquer a\Nstrategy that's been used for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.57,0:12:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.91,0:12:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,When you get that look in your\Neye, I believe everything you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.59,0:12:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think Yugi wants\Nyou to be the grand prize winner?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.99,0:12:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a duelist, too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.59,0:12:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,To win, you'll eventually\Nhave to take him on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We will have to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.77,0:12:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.59,0:12:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you're the best friend I ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.01,0:12:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.92,0:12:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll rescue your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.21,0:12:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.25,0:12:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We are a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.61,0:12:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But I also have to win\Nthe contest for Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.09,0:12:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sending you this video just so you\Ndon't forget your little sister's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.45,0:13:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like I'm running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.91,0:13:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.09,0:13:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Yuki's right about this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.41,0:13:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to stop listening to Mai's\Nnonsense and start using my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.89,0:13:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I just gotta concentrate\Non how to win the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a way to beat Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.01,0:13:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can just figure out how\Nshe knows what her cards are,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.33,0:13:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,if she's not psychic, there must\Nbe something else she's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.69,0:13:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that strange smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.65,0:13:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I never noticed that smell\Nwhen my eyes were open.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.17,0:13:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm smelling a bunch of different\Nperfumes coming from her cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.25,0:13:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.55,0:13:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I see through your card trick. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.93,0:13:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You sprayed all your cards\Nwith different perfumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.87,0:13:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And by smelling each different scent,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.21,0:14:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,you can tell which card is which\Neven when they're face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.59,0:14:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So you don't have to look\Nin order to play your cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.93,0:14:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That way you can psych\Nthe other player out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.14,0:14:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How could an amateur punk like\Nyou see through my aroma strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.81,0:14:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta admit, Mai, you really had me\Nbuying into the whole psychic powers shtick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.37,0:14:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I was too freaked out to think\Nthings through because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're not a psychic at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.07,0:14:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a big fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.99,0:14:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get her, Joey. You the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.13,0:14:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.83,0:14:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because you saw through\Nmy little psychic act doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.25,0:14:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,mean you're going to be\Nable to defeat me in a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.17,0:14:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.57,0:14:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Before, you were winning by confusing me\Nand trying to pit me against my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.97,0:14:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But now my mind is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.19,0:14:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I know who I can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.87,0:14:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All you've got left is your cheap tricks,\Nand I won't fall for them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.43,0:14:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna blast your harpies\Nout of the sky with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.07,0:14:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Good card, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.27,0:14:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.51,0:15:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That wimpy card is your grand play?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.15,0:15:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I only wish it was worth some\Nmore so when I devastate you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.03,0:15:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,it would do more damage\Nto your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My card will be Elegant Egotist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.77,0:15:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Its magic will make duplicates\Nof my harpies, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.05,0:15:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.63,0:15:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpies, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.35,0:15:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's three times the trouble. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.19,0:15:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He was struggling when there was only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.29,0:15:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give in, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.55,0:15:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You've still got all kinds of moves left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.61,0:15:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.52,0:15:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What moves would those be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.43,0:15:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How would I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.35,0:15:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask an expert. Ask Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.25,0:15:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Joey's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.49,0:15:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He has to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.59,0:15:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any cards strong\Nenough to beat three harpy ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.79,0:15:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.87,0:15:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to keep\Nusing the magic of elegant
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.37,0:15:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,egotists to double my harpies\Nagain and again each turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But while my harpies multiply, I\Ncan't attack you, so it's your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.87,0:15:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, you'll soon\Nbe up against an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.37,0:15:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,An army of harpies?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.93,0:16:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How the heck do I fight an army?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.67,0:16:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got a whole army.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.13,0:16:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to beat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.99,0:16:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up, Joey. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.35,0:16:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Think hard about her strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.23,0:16:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been using only one monster card and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.43,0:16:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,strengthening that one\Ncard with many magic cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.51,0:16:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's a serious flaw in\Nher dueling strategy, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.07,0:16:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Using magic on one card? That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.97,0:16:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just been juicing up\Nthe harpy ladies every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.39,0:16:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But if she has mostly magic cards, maybe\Nthe harpy ladies are her only monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet if I can just defeat her harpy,\Nshe won't have any monsters left to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.13,0:16:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.17,0:16:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now think, what card in\Nyour deck will help you win?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.09,0:16:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Which of my cards? You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.21,0:16:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I think maybe you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.19,0:16:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamandra and a kunai with chain?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.47,0:16:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby dragon and shield and sword? Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.97,0:16:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,With these new magic cards\Ncombined with your monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.15,0:17:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have a real strong deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.83,0:17:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.85,0:17:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, add this to your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.87,0:17:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It can be helpful in a tight spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.61,0:17:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Time Wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.61,0:17:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the kind of tight spot\NYugi must have been talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.81,0:17:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if I can just remember what Gramps\Ntaught me about the way to use a magic card,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.07,0:17:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,it's my only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.31,0:17:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But do I have it in my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.15,0:17:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had known how long it was\Ngoing to take you to make a move,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.93,0:17:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have brought a magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The time wizard's not in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to draw for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.49,0:17:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if I don't get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.25,0:17:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What if...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.16,0:17:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust in your cards, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.55,0:17:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.71,0:17:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.97,0:17:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.67,0:17:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.99,0:17:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Time Wizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.23,0:17:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What good is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.05,0:17:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.27,0:17:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The Time Wizard can make time go faster,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.77,0:18:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,causing my baby dragon to grow into\Na thousand dragon. Right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.53,0:18:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's not the only effect\Nyour Time Wizard will have.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.81,0:18:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Time Wizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.91,0:18:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby dragon, transform\Ninto a thousand dragons!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.55,0:18:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So now you have a bigger dragon. Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.85,0:18:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My harpy ladies still\Nhave greater attack power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.37,0:18:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack it, my three harpy sisters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.41,0:18:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.32,0:18:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to my harpy ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.17,0:18:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They've gotten so old!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.41,0:18:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.83,0:18:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A millennium has passed\Non the playing field and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.99,0:18:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,your harpy ladies have\Nbecome old and decrepit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.93,0:18:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it, Mai, time's running\Nout for you and your ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.77,0:18:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I believed, and the cards\Ncame through for me. Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.91,0:18:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Thousand Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.63,0:18:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack with Inferno! Flame Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.29,0:19:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it! Joey won!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.59,0:19:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.89,0:19:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.97,0:19:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.89,0:19:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I ever lose to such an amateur?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.55,0:19:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mai. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.57,0:19:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.79,0:19:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,there's more to duel monsters than\Njust kicking the other guy's butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.53,0:19:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're ever going\Nto be a real champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.87,0:19:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,you've got to learn to care about someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.35,0:19:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Other than yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.89,0:19:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.67,0:19:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.97,0:19:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.91,0:19:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All your hard work and training paid off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.61,0:19:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You went from a guy with nothing\Nbut eagerness and attitude
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.47,0:19:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,to a winning duelist who battles\Nwith his head and his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.73,0:19:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
